{"id":"92256ad8556a5baf","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-bool-query.md","title":"同构不变的布尔查询","display":"df-bool-query — 同构不变的布尔查询","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-bool-query","aliases":["29-df-bool-query"],"display":"df-bool-query — 同构不变的布尔查询","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-bool-query"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-bool-query</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bool-query — 同构不变的布尔查询"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 遍历元语言中满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 的结构性质类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\">\\(S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 表示下式给出的性质模式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\\)</span> 不作为一个由任意真类组成的集合。类概括与类成员记号按这一模式使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in S\\leftrightarrow B\\in S)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\in\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\sigma]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\bigl(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in S\\leftrightarrow B\\in S)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>结构性质及其同构不变条件均在前两节给出；本条的集合式排版只是元语言分类记号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"